+ * D2FQ (FAST'21, ioext 7.x port) task-election open flag: reads/writes via
+ * a file opened with O_D2FQ tag the calling task (PF_D2FQ) so the D2FQ
+ * block-layer state classifies its requests.  Declared deviation 1: the
+ * reference used 040000000 (bit 26) which is the internal O_EMPTYPATH in
